        "thought_text": "Model the operation as repeatedly subtracting K until the result is less than K, which is equivalent to N % K, then consider the reflection K - (N % K) as the next possible state in the cycle.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-8300355126084302786",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794506490.6849186
